WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Picture a voice saying “ba.” Now picture lips moving for “ga.”

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Put the two together. Some listeners report a third syllable: “da.”

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The soundtrack didn't change. Their perception did.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But the illusion varies with the viewer, the clip, and even the choices offered.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A vivid experience is not a blanket scientific proof.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ask what was tested. Then ask what was only promised. Final Vestige.
